[[6,127,8,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the vehicle on the ramp.</p><p>Ensure that the ignition key is in stop\nposition, then disconnect the battery negative terminal.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3235044\">A1B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/3237652\">1016A40</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/3237529\">1048A34</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/3237705\">1076B50</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/3237701\">1072D10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Disconnect the vacuum pipe complete with one-way valves (1a)\nfrom the brake servo side and remove it, after releasing it from\nthe band (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2017883.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[6,127,8,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Refit in its seating the vacuum pipe complete\nwith one-way valves, connect it to the vacuum unit and secure it\nwith its band.</p><p><a href=\"#/3237701\">1072D10</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/3237705\">1076B50</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/3237529\">1048A34</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/3237652\">1016A40</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Connect the battery  terminal (-).</p><p>Remove the car from the ramp.</p>"]]